      "label": "Everybody needs a friend",
      "description": "A common social trope suggesting that friendship is universally necessary. In this meme, it is used ironically and inappropriately to suggest that the atomic bombings were a 'friend' to Japan, which is a deeply offensive and harmful analogy.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_2162fff6"
