      "@type": "AnalogicalMapping",
      "instance_name": "mapping_id_1",
      "label": "The atomic bombings are mapped as a 'friend'",
      "description": "The text 'everybody needs a friend' is juxtaposed with the visual of the map of Japan labeled with 'hiroshima' and 'nagasaki', creating an analogical mapping where the catastrophic historical event (atomic bombings) is equated with the concept of a 'friend'. This is a harmful and offensive analogy that trivializes the immense human suffering and genocide-level trauma caused by the bombings.",
