      "description": "The meme trivializes the atomic bombings of Hiroshima and Nagasaki by equating them with a 'friend', reducing a genocide-level historical trauma to a joke. This is deeply offensive to survivors (hibakusha) and their descendants, and can cause emotional harm. It aligns with 'holocaust denial/minimization themes' by downplaying the catastrophic human suffering.",
